  "body": "BSD readlink does not have the `~~f`-flag. demo/start.dh fails with `readlink: illegal option -~~ f` on line 11.\n\nAs a workaround: You can remove the `-f`-flag and have a worse `$PYTHONPATH`, or, if you have `brew`, you can install GNU `coreutils` and use `greadlink` instead.\n\nI'm not sure what is a good fix.\n\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-500)\n\n(Reported by Mathias Dannesbo)",
